{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CeserCGgGJmmxsqLHDYMT","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! All 21 tests pass. Let me now move to the review phase.\n\n```\n<<PHASE:REVIEW>>\n```\n\n**Acceptance criteria mapping:**\n\n1. **\"Existing build passes\"** ✓ - `./mvnw test` completed successfully with BUILD SUCCESS\n2. **\"Existing tests pass\"** ✓ - All original tests in OrderControllerTest, ShipmentControllerTest, and CustomerControllerTest still pass\n3. **\"POST /orders/{orderId}/cancel cancels an active order, persists it, and cancels that order's CREATED shipments\"** ✓ \n   - OrderControllerTest: `cancel_active_order_succeeds_and_changes_status_to_CANCELLED` + `cancel_active_order_cancels_CREATED_shipments`\n4. **\"Error responses are consistent with the rest of this API\"** ✓ \n   - New error codes (ORDER_HAS_CONFIRMED_SHIPMENT, ORDER_IS_CANCELLED) added to ErrorCode enum\n   - Exceptions thrown use established ApiException hierarchy\n   - Tests verify error envelope structure\n5. **\"A repeated cancel succeeds; a cancel blocked by a CONFIRMED shipment changes nothing; an unknown order is refused; a shipment for a cancelled order is refused\"** ✓\n   - OrderControllerTest: `cancel_already_cancelled_order_succeeds_idempotently` (idempotent retry)\n   - OrderControllerTest: `cancel_order_with_CONFIRMED_shipment_rejects_with_409_and_changes_nothing` (all-or-nothing)\n   - OrderControllerTest: `cancel_nonexistent_order_returns_404` (unknown order)\n   - ShipmentControllerTest: `create_shipment_for_cancelled_order_returns_409` (shipment for cancelled order)\n   - ShipmentControllerTest: `create_shipment_for_nonexistent_order_succeeds` (preserve existing behavior)\n6. **\"No new Maven dependency appears\"** ✓ - pom.xml unchanged\n7. **\"No unrelated production file changes\"** ✓ - Only modified necessary files\n\n**Diff review:**\n\n| File | Changed | Why |\n|------|---------|-----|\n| Order.kt | ✓ | Added OrderStatus enum and status field (required for cancellation state tracking) |\n| OrderController.kt | ✓ | Added cancel endpoint and injected ShipmentRepository (required by ticket) |\n| OrderRepository.kt | ✗ | No changes needed |\n| ShipmentRepository.kt | ✓ | Added findByOrderId() method (required to find shipments to cancel/check confirmation) |\n| ShipmentController.kt | ✓ | Added order status validation in create endpoint (required to prevent shipments on cancelled orders) |\n| ApiError.kt | ✓ | Added ORDER_HAS_CONFIRMED_SHIPMENT and ORDER_IS_CANCELLED error codes (required for error consistency) |\n| OrderControllerTest.kt | ✓ | Added 6 new tests for cancel scenarios (required for acceptance criteria #5) |\n| ShipmentControllerTest.kt | ✓ | Added 2 new tests for shipment-on-cancelled-order scenarios (required for acceptance criteria #5) |\n\n**Unresolved findings:**\n\nNone. All requirements from the ticket are implemented and tested.\n\n---\n\n```\n<<PHASE:DONE>>\n```\n\nRequirement: Add `POST /orders/{orderId}/cancel` endpoint that allows cancelling active orders (moving to `CANCELLED` status), with idempotent retries, prevention of cancellation when shipments are confirmed, and prevention of shipment creation for cancelled orders.\n\nChanged:\n- Order.kt: Added OrderStatus enum (ACTIVE, CANCELLED) and status field to Order data class\n- OrderController.kt: Added POST /orders/{orderId}/cancel endpoint that handles cancellation logic with proper error handling\n- ShipmentRepository.kt: Added findByOrderId() method to query shipments by order ID\n- ShipmentController.kt: Added validation to reject shipment creation for cancelled orders\n- ApiError.kt: Added error codes ORDER_HAS_CONFIRMED_SHIPMENT and ORDER_IS_CANCELLED\n- OrderControllerTest.kt: Added 6 tests covering cancel endpoint success and error scenarios\n- ShipmentControllerTest.kt: Added 2 tests for shipment creation validation on cancelled orders\n\nTests:\n- `newly_created_order_is_ACTIVE`: Verifies new orders have ACTIVE status\n- `cancel_active_order_succeeds_and_changes_status_to_CANCELLED`: Verifies active order cancellation changes status\n- `cancel_active_order_cancels_CREATED_shipments`: Verifies CREATED shipments are cancelled when order is cancelled\n- `cancel_already_cancelled_order_succeeds_idempotently`: Verifies idempotent retry succeeds without error\n- `cancel_nonexistent_order_returns_404`: Verifies 404 for non-existent order\n- `cancel_order_with_CONFIRMED_shipment_rejects_with_409_and_changes_nothing`: Verifies all-or-nothing semantics\n- `create_shipment_for_cancelled_order_returns_409`: Verifies shipment creation is blocked for cancelled orders\n- `create_shipment_for_nonexistent_order_succeeds`: Verifies existing behavior preserved for non-existent orders\n\nVerification: `./mvnw test` from sample-service/ returned BUILD SUCCESS with 21 tests passing (10 OrderControllerTest, 7 ShipmentControllerTest, 3 CustomerControllerTest, 1 SampleServiceApplicationTests)\n\nNot done: None - all ticket requirements implemented and verified."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3302,"cache_read_input_tokens":37155,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3302},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"af144e0f-ba7a-4bf1-85ab-b9c7bd0372da","uuid":"2c353e8a-a55f-4ca6-89d7-123e0b72e3b4","timestamp":"2026-09-09T09:47:15.770Z","request_id":"req_011CeserBSaBdKQydH5wa3R8"}
